                    <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" FontSize="12" Foreground="{DynamicResource TextMutedBrush}"
                               LineHeight="21" FontFamily="{StaticResource UiFont}">
                      Measures the real experience of visiting a website: DNS lookup, TCP connect,
                      TLS handshake, time-to-first-byte (TTFB) and single-connection download speed.<LineBreak/>
                      3 polite sequential requests are made — this reflects the network path and CDN
